---
import Html from "../layouts/Html.astro";
import HomeHero from "../components/home/HomeHero.astro";
import HomeSecHeading from "../components/home/HomeSecHeading.astro";
import ResponsivePadding from "../components/ResponsivePadding.astro";
import HomeSecParagraph from "../components/home/HomeSecParagraph.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import HomeSecTriFeature from "../components/home/HomeSecTriFeature.astro";
import HomeSecTriFeatureItem from "../components/home/HomeSecTriFeatureItem.astro";
import HomeSecComparisonTable from "../components/home/comparisonTable/HomeSecComparisonTable.astro";
import MainContainer from "../components/MainContainer.astro";

import PricingSection from "../components/pricing/PricingSection.astro";
import RowCustomisation from "../components/home/reusable/RowCustomisation.astro";
import RowTemplates from "../components/home/reusable/RowTemplates.astro";
import RowConfiguration from "../components/home/reusable/RowConfiguration.astro";
import RowDesigns from "../components/home/reusable/RowDesigns.astro";
import HomeSecContact from "../components/home/reusable/HomeSecContact.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/navbar/Navbar.svelte";
---

<Html title="The Encrypted Survey Platform">
	<Navbar />

	<MainContainer>
		<HomeHero />

		<ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
			<HomeSecHeading size="big" id="features">
				Stop compromising on privacy
			</HomeSecHeading>
			<HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
				With Palform, responses to your forms are <strong
					>encrypted before going anywhere.</strong
				>
				This makes them completely invisible to any except the submitter and
				you. We can't see the responses; only you hold the keys.
			</HomeSecParagraph>
			<HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
				All this with <strong>zero added hassle.</strong> Our forms are just
				as easy to create as on any other platform, and no technical knowledge
				is needed whatsoever. Just enter your questions, publish your form,
				and you're ready to go.
			</HomeSecParagraph>
		</ResponsivePadding>

		<RowDesigns class="mt-20" />
		<RowConfiguration class="mt-20" />
		<RowTemplates class="mt-20" />
		<RowCustomisation class="mt-20" />

		<ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
			<HomeSecHeading size="big" id="compliance">
				Ultra secure data collection
			</HomeSecHeading>
			<HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
				Palform
				<strong>encrypts all your responses</strong>, massively reducing
				the risk of data breaches and increasing trust amongst your
				users. Encrypted-by-default forms is something almost no-one
				else does.
			</HomeSecParagraph>
			<HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
				In fact, if our servers get compromised or a government compels
				us to hand over data, all we'll have is a limited amount of
				metadata, but not the responses themselves.
			</HomeSecParagraph>
			<HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
				<strong> It doesn't just end at encryption: </strong>
				we're based in the UK 🇬🇧 and our servers are hosted in the EU 🇪🇺,
				subjecting us to some of the strictest privacy laws in the world.
				We also use
				<a
					href="https://docs.palform.app/blog/2024/09/08/security"
					target="_blank"
					class="underline">a range of other security measures</a
				>
				to protect your data. You can trust Palform with even your most sensitive
				forms, because nobody can see your data. <strong
					>Not even us.</strong
				>
			</HomeSecParagraph>

			<Button class="mt-4" light href="/features/encryption">
				Learn more
			</Button>

			<HomeSecComparisonTable class="mt-10" />
		</ResponsivePadding>

		<ResponsivePadding class="mt-32 space-y-12">
			<HomeSecTriFeature>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Secure integrations"
					icon="fa6-solid:share-nodes"
					link="https://docs.palform.app/api/getting_started"
				>
					Connect to encrypted webhooks and emails, or use our API for
					full programmatic access.
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Fully anonymous"
					icon="fa6-solid:mask"
				>
					Absolutely zero tracking, ads, or analytics in your form
					fill pages. Gain stronger trust and avoid breaches.
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Easy link sharing"
					icon="fa6-solid:qrcode"
					link="https://docs.palform.app/forms/publishing/"
				>
					Generate a QR code or a powerful short link in just 2
					clicks, making your branding super powerful.
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
			</HomeSecTriFeature>
			<HomeSecTriFeature>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Easy GDPR compliance"
					icon="fa6-solid:section"
				>
					Auto-delete old form responses and manage org-wide Privacy
					Policies in a few clicks
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Great for enterprise"
					icon="fa6-solid:user-group"
					link="https://docs.palform.app/orgs/teams"
				>
					Manage hundreds of users with hierarchical permissions, an
					OIDC integration, and audit logs.
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Insightful reports"
					icon="fa6-solid:chart-pie"
				>
					Generate correlation analysis and beautiful graphs for your
					data with no extra work
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
			</HomeSecTriFeature>
			<HomeSecTriFeature>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Multilingual support"
					icon="fa6-solid:language"
				>
					The form-filling interface is available in English and
					German, with more coming soon
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Versatile question types"
					icon="fa6-solid:gear"
					link="https://docs.palform.app/forms/questions/#question-types"
				>
					E-signatures, address search, secure file uploads, and more:
					all for no extra charge.
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
				<HomeSecTriFeatureItem
					title="Spam prevention"
					icon="fa6-solid:robot"
				>
					Add a privacy-respecting Altcha captcha in a single click to
					reduce automated spam responses.
				</HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
			</HomeSecTriFeature>
		</ResponsivePadding>

		<ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
			<PricingSection />
		</ResponsivePadding>

		<ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
			<HomeSecContact />
		</ResponsivePadding>
	</MainContainer>
</Html>
